{
  "info": {
    "name": "Fixture Unguarded Capture",
    "description": "Fixture for this skill's self-test. Not a real service.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Issue token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"code\": \"000000\"}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/tokens",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "tokens"
              ]
            },
            "description": "## Purpose\nIssue a bearer access token so later requests in this fixture folder can authenticate.\n\n## Flow position\nFirst request in the folder. Populates `access_token`, which later requests reference.\n\n## Request\nPOST a JSON body carrying the operator identifier and the one-time code.\n\n## Response\n200 with the success envelope; `data.token.access_token` carries the credential.\n\n## Access\nPublic route. It is the route that mints a credential, so it needs none.\n\n## Errors\n422 when the one-time code is wrong. The caller re-prompts instead of retrying.\n\n## Frontend notes\nHold the token in memory for the session; never write it to local storage.\n\n## Security notes\nThe body carries a one-time code: never log it, never commit a real value here."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('access_token', String(pm.response.json().data.token.access_token));",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Correlation header is returned', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.has('X-Request-Id')).to.be.true;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 Token issued",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\"code\": \"000000\"}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/tokens",
                  "host": [
                    "{{base_url}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "v1",
                    "tokens"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "code": 200,
              "status": "OK",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                },
                {
                  "key": "X-Request-Id",
                  "value": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\"data\": {\"token\": {\"access_token\": \"<replace-me>\"}}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "422 Invalid one-time code",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\"code\": \"000000\"}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/tokens",
                  "host": [
                    "{{base_url}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "v1",
                    "tokens"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "code": 422,
              "status": "Unprocessable Entity",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                },
                {
                  "key": "X-Request-Id",
                  "value": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\"error\": {\"code\": \"VALIDATION_FAILED\"}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "https://api.example.test"
    }
  ]
}
